      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會決定進現在的快遞公司\n也是因為公司的標誌用了鳥寶可夢！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n……雖然標誌是烈箭鷹啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167036C7A5B9A903273FE572876845FEB905E516C53F8000A4E5F662F56E070BA516C53F876846A198A8C75284E869CE55BF653EF5922FF0100100001BE01000A2026202696D671366A198A8C662F70C87BAD9DF95566300200100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還有大比鳥牠們用的飛翔，\n這個招式也超厲害的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084670959276BD49CE5726050117528768498DB7FD4FF0C000A9019500B62DB5F0F4E5F8D8553B25BB37684FF0100100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要不要嚐嚐看\n波波、比比鳥、大比鳥的飛翔攻擊？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
